Z||000006||maryjane||08-25-2001||08:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hugh:<BR><B>What is chicken fried bacon?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Ever eat a chicken fried steak? Sorta like that.Mix milk,slightly beaten egg. mix flour,pepper,chili powder. Dip bacon slices in egg/milk mixture, coat with flour, deep fry it. Serve with fried jalapenos. An acquired taste. Not for the health conscious!<BR>||||reg||1
