Z||000019||hugh||08-26-2001||09:24 AM||||Here's a great dessert.<BR> I do refrigeration work for some farmers who raise blueberries.I have a freezer full of them frozen.Put them in a bowl and pour in half and half or light cream while you turn the berries to coat them.They turn into big frozen marbles that taste great.You can add some sugar to make them sweeter. ||||reg||1
